@startuml
title HCP-D06 Conditional Vendor Payment Acknowledgment Flow
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Resolved Site POS Server" as POS
participant "HikCentral connector" as Connector
participant "HCP payment acknowledgment capability" as HCP
participant "Reconciliation" as Recon
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Central -> Central : platform payment finality recorded
Central -> POS : Sales Invoice issuance
POS --> Central : fiscal identity/status
Central -> Central : fiscal reference recorded
alt HCP confirmation approved and enabled
  Central -> Connector : request HCP acknowledgment
  Connector -> HCP : mutating confirmation call
  HCP --> Connector : acknowledgment / failure / unknown
  Connector --> Central : normalized vendor outcome
else not approved or not confirmed
  Central -> Recon : keep acknowledgment disabled / open
end
Central -> Audit : conditional acknowledgment context

note bottom
parkingfee/confirm is mutating and disabled until approved.
HCP acknowledgment is not ExitPass payment finality.
end note
@enduml
